{"type":"Film","id":"FR2015_018","slug":"fr2015-018-en-quete-de-sens","title":{"native":"En quête de sens","english":""},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-01-28","year":2015},"filmType":"Documentary","directors":[{"id":"Nathanaël Coste","slug":"nathanael-coste","name":"Nathanaël Coste","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"Marc De La Ménardière","Marc de la Ménardière"],"genre":["Documentary – Participatory mode"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/148/107/158612/format_page/en-quete-de-sens.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KFaGJ3nEoMc"},"synopsis":{"native":"En quête de sens, c’est l’histoire de deux amis d'enfance qui ont décidé de partir autour du monde à la rencontre de philosophes, de paysans, de scientifiques ou de chamanes pour trouver des réponses à leurs questions : Comment la civilisation occidentale en est-elle arrivée là et par où commencer pour faire changer les choses ? Tissé autour de rencontres improbables, de doutes et de joies, ce voyage initiatique filmé sans artifices questionne les croyances collectives qui façonnent la civilisation occidentale et apporte un message d’espoir à ceux qui se sentent impuissants devant leur poste de télévision.","english":"Two childhood friends travel the world to meet some of the greatest thinkers of our time. This incredible voyage, full of moments of doubt and moments of joy, will lead them to question the very beliefs that have shaped Western civilization. This film captures the change in human consciousness currently happening all over the planet, and the desire to live in harmony with oneself and the world."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Bruce Lipton","slug":"bruce-lipton","name":"Bruce Lipton","birthYear":1944,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Documentar